{"type":"message","id":"5e0ea257","parentId":"0e191f8f","timestamp":"2026-06-04T05:41:40.653Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Thu 2026-06-04 05:41 UTC] [Subagent Context] You are running as a subagent (depth 1/1). Results auto-announce to your requester; do not busy-poll for status.\n\n[Subagent Task]: Publish the final article to WordPress as a draft.\n1. Read /tmp/crypto-run-20260604-050655/article/final.md\n2. Upload the featured image at /tmp/crypto-run-20260604-050655/article/feature.png to WordPress and get its ID. (If missing, just skip the image).\n3. Draft the post with the markdown body, using the H1 as the title. Set the featured image ID. Category: \"News\".\n4. Write ONLY the final WordPress edit URL to /tmp/wp-result.txt.\n5. Yield back \"SUCCESS\"."}],"timestamp":1780551700642}}
