{"type":"message","id":"280a5a72","parentId":"5c45e484","timestamp":"2026-06-04T05:41:56.889Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"read_ts_AY89a19eIyp58jTv5Tp8kB3UNsM53bBhkYvAyY5NFW6Nns3s3DF2Lh4G6JVNLZcPtuu0D285Rr0D9SfSD9WzQA2RfAhZtyPHZ5FFy8JQ3CzSzHlXnQbRKdg7-MtEECZeGroeoc6U3K5MEzZMLWaN-_TH3RcuNv6SWXGSDMDv9reNfL-a-2I1Uz9osib0aoRc8ub2YJX1Xb3pxxBoq8xmjiIOOy3NDP9ZW9zFqBB2hGevw_OFM9Eb9J1wsT4-jhI_ZZHmp1QeEtSwbTCteBNRbk1QRCu0wiZZ0mLzAUg6q0uNzTeOEfJ2mbu5KRSgGEVe1Ib-XHLf88hsXtC7D_9PWFbBfwG5v5UwpVLNvYVlwRJfcguV9lD2Kuk2iM1J7LAq9YydiEVbjsWv984fm3bzqx3oAFJ3sOnhzCyNibzp_jkLtsI2gkxsCb2PQTeBbG9jKenc7RD16B4v60Z62gljaz6RdLPPbM_foIMu9U-0uJcAizW_iPkyosv4pzv4oz3v6APpzaD6N7qp1QvZ9LQ3UqrXZjL_yo2I5nhhTIpJDWgxZvRONI-i5GFSDb0j9ZErOgD5qvqYThzJa_3H4cvF-EZBHvWulol0mQaTFqgXLds_-CQIyb8jY7pjSa6-SlLalFzyKaSbDLZOqfWBxvjMFNwvKLCrtpWNUeVF05abp693BR5GFGUwtk40z42kGQOIkSHX3o2B31nqS9zHtCKBFP14L9DEY7Pf_1LOvffaX4viJ3gFrgaQz1R1A02dvNNKEFLgBAt6WHx8Ur5qmJdEtoUmFPO9HLF_w8Zdr62Cwz_y0Kdp01wTyk-ZHdD0JSej3pk8TK83DMcSJrNK_A-FUusg-ha2_VAlLcnD6Jlzv9G9ix7BqUoQ047_NqhZljZAEVzF1mv6ykiihNSrvDl9f2OId9bTvpogI780i3L39bHnlPOhgl3BJKRn8-oYKctV8nlA29Yq54FX44DRItOyJq_C6eTShDfHVJWCVhe7-0jhQpQUIDjrRkUdbxlWOr0c5ypSCeznO_5GrCLm-SLQZc3QtNEjmzifefV5eFsf5YE9","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"META\n- SEO Title: Pi Network Protocol 24 Deploys as $PI Price Hits Lows\n- Meta Description: Pi Network Protocol 24 is now live, but the upgrade hasn't helped the $PI price. Learn what the update means for the network's future and why bears remain in control.\n- URL Slug: pi-network-protocol-24-price-impact\n- Categories: L1/L2 Protocol\n- Primary Keyword: Pi Network Protocol 24\n- Secondary Keywords: Pi Network price, Pi Network upgrade\n\n---\n\n# Pi Network Protocol 24 Deploys as $PI Price Plummets to Yearly Lows\n\nThe **Pi Network Protocol 24** upgrade is officially rolling out, marking a significant technical step forward for the project. Despite the complex update, the network’s native token, $PI, has not responded, continuing to trade near its lowest levels of the year. The milestone highlights a growing divergence between the project's development progress and its market valuation, leaving traders to weigh technical advancements against severe price pressure.\n\nThe upgrade, which began its mainnet deployment on June 3, is one of the most substantial in the network’s history. It is intended to boost performance, improve node synchronization, and create a more stable foundation for future features. While the development team is accelerating its roadmap, the market appears more concerned with tokenomics and immediate supply pressures.\n\n## Pi Network's Ambitious Upgrade Schedule\n\nPi Network is accelerating its development with a series of rapid protocol upgrades scheduled for June. This push signals a clear intent to move the project toward greater functionality and utility, even as the market remains skeptical. The compressed timeline is a notable shift for a project that has been building for years.\n\n### A Rapid-Fire Rollout\n\nThe deployment of **Pi Network Protocol 24** is just the beginning of a busy month. The team has scheduled Protocol v25.1 for June 8 and v26.0 for June 22. This rapid sequencing demonstrates a significant pickup in development pace. [According to BeInCrypto](https://beincrypto.com/pi-network-protocol-24-upgrade-pi-price-all-time-low/), these updates are targeting node performance, scalability, and the maturation of smart contract capabilities, which have long been on the project's roadmap. For a network that has been criticized for its slow progress, three major protocol releases in a single month represent a statement of intent.\n\n### Testnet Success Paves the Way\n\nBefore the mainnet activation, the Protocol 24 upgrade was successfully completed and synchronized on Testnet 2. This crucial step ensured that the complex changes were stable enough for the live network. All mainnet node operators were required to upgrade by June 2 or face disconnection, a strict deadline to ensure a smooth transition. The successful testnet trial was a key validator for the broader rollout.\n\n## Protocol 24's Technical Foundation\n\nThe **Pi Network Protocol 24** update is more than a simple version change; it represents a deep infrastructural overhaul. The changes lay the groundwork for the network's long-term vision of off-chain integration and cross-chain capabilities, preparing the ecosystem for a new class of applications and tools.\n\n### What V24 Means for Developers\n\nFor developers building on Pi, the upgrade is a critical step toward a more functional ecosystem. The new architecture introduces the technical foundation for off-chain integrations, which is a prerequisite for connecting with external blockchains and Layer-2 solutions. This is the first step in a roadmap that promises to deliver full smart contract support, decentralized applications, and potentially a native Pi DEX. As seen with the recent success of CiDi Games, which attracted over 80,000 users in its first week, applications can gain significant traction within the existing Pi user base. V24 aims to make the platform more attractive for these kinds of builders.\n\n## Price Woes and Unlocking Pressure\n\nDespite the positive technical news, the price of $PI tells a different story. The token continues to face significant headwinds, with major token unlocks and bearish market sentiment erasing any potential momentum from the protocol upgrades.\n\n### A Bear in Firm Control\n\nAs of early June, $PI was trading at approximately $0.127, having fallen 27% year-to-date and sitting at its lowest point since mid-February. The price has fallen below all its moving averages, a technical signal that sellers are firmly in control. The problem is compounded by a massive supply overhang. [Coinfomania reports](https://coinfomania.com/pi-network-testnet-2-completes-v24-upgrade-ahead-of-mainnet/) that over 200 million PI tokens are scheduled to be unlocked, creating sustained sell pressure. In June alone, unlocks are estimated to be worth over $26 million. This constant stream of new supply entering a thin market makes it difficult for the price to establish a bottom, let alone rally on development news.\n\n## Conclusion\n\nThe rollout of **Pi Network Protocol 24** marks a critical achievement in the project's technical roadmap, paving the way for smart contracts and broader utility. However, this development progress is completely detached from market reality. With the $PI price languishing near all-time lows and facing immense pressure from token unlocks, traders are ignoring the long-term vision in favor of short-term tokenomics. Until the ecosystem can generate enough demand to absorb the new supply, the technical advancements are unlikely to translate into positive price action.\n\n## FAQs\n**1. What is Pi Network Protocol 24?**\n\n[15 more lines in file. Use offset=51 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1780551716888}}
